# Sweep output. Baselines are committed; a Scorecard from an ad-hoc run is not, and an untracked
# one left in the tree would mark the harness dirty and block the next Baseline promotion.
apps/eval/scorecards/
apps/eval/scorecard-*.txt

# Planning notes for work in progress — the spec and tickets behind a change, not the change.
# They are written for whoever is building it and go stale the moment it lands.
.scratch/

# Failure screenshot from the browser smoke run (scripts/test/browser-smoke.mjs). Diagnostic
# output from a local run; an untracked one at the root marks the tree dirty for every later check.
/browser-smoke-failure.png

